        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090450/extras/395ffcc2f584f50ab264e95258c01a58.avif?t=1774516473\" width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help save the kitties from the zombie apocalypse!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 huge maps </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 objects to find (cats and zombies) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 special objects (milk bottles) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint system Progress saving </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress reset </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090450/extras/bbf6081f87231d10b1b4995424f4decb.avif?t=1774516473\" width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats VS Zombies is a hidden object game – the player's task is to find cats hidden on the map and eliminate the zombies. The game is designed in a zombie apocalypse style, but with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to contamination, an epidemic has broken out – zombies have taken over the entire town and are wreaking havoc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last survivor, once a member of an elite cat sniper unit. The cat army has dropped ammunition supplies – these can be found in wooden crates. Your mission is to eliminate all the zombies and rescue the cats. Go, cat soldier! Meow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090450/extras/395ffcc2f584f50ab264e95258c01a58.avif?t=1774516473\" width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help save the kitties from the zombie apocalypse!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 huge maps </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 objects to find (cats and zombies) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 special objects (milk bottles) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint system Progress saving </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress reset </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090450/extras/bbf6081f87231d10b1b4995424f4decb.avif?t=1774516473\" width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats VS Zombies is a hidden object game – the player's task is to find cats hidden on the map and eliminate the zombies. The game is designed in a zombie apocalypse style, but with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to contamination, an epidemic has broken out – zombies have taken over the entire town and are wreaking havoc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last survivor, once a member of an elite cat sniper unit. The cat army has dropped ammunition supplies – these can be found in wooden crates. Your mission is to eliminate all the zombies and rescue the cats. Go, cat soldier! Meow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
